#: setup.php
msgid "Terminal Type"
msgstr "Terminaltyp"

#: setup.php
msgid ""
"Provide a list of ports on a specific switch/hub whose MAC results should be"
" ignored.  Ports such as link/trunk ports that can not be distinguished from"
" other user ports are examples.  Each port number must be separated by a "
"colon, pipe, or a space ':', '|', ' '.  For example, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' or "
"'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' would be acceptable for some manufacturers switch types."
msgstr ""
"Ange en lista över portar på en viss switch eller hubb vars MAC-resultat ska"
" ignoreras. Det kan till exempel vara länkportar eller trunkportar som inte "
"kan skiljas från andra användarportar. Portnumren ska separeras med kolon "
"':', lodstreck '|' eller mellanslag ' '. För vissa tillverkares switchar "
"fungerar exempelvis 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' eller 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23'."
